message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "VPN LIFE Dataset: daily VPN infrastructure measurements"
abstract: >-
  A daily, timestamped record of VPN infrastructure built by fetching the public
  server lists that VPN providers publish and counting them per country. Covers
  7 providers and 155 countries.
  Every row carries its observation date. Unmeasured values are left empty.
type: dataset
